  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 3.2.0:\n- Added AnthropicProvider for Claude models (Messages API)\n- Added provider-neutral ReasoningEffort (LLMRequest.WithReasoningEffort and the LLMClient reasoningEffort argument) for OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, DeepSeek and LLM Studio\n- Added LLMResponse.Reasoning and LLMClient.LastReasoning to read the reasoning returned by the provider\n- OpenAI: sampling parameters (temperature, top_p, penalties) are no longer sent to GPT-5 and o-series reasoning models, which reject them\n- Gemini: thought summaries are separated from the answer text\n- Permanent 4xx errors are no longer retried, and the API error response is included in the exception message\n\nVersion 3.1.0:\n- Added LLMStudioProvider for local LLM Studio servers (OpenAI-compatible API, optional API key)\n- Fixed OpenAI request payload to use max_completion_tokens\n- Improved error detail in generated text failure exceptions\n\nVersion 3.0.0:\n- Added multimodal support for text and images\n- Enhanced conversation management with improved message history\n- Added system message configuration\n- Implemented automatic retries for failed requests\n- Improved thread safety and error handling\n- Updated to .NET 8.0\n- Added comprehensive XML documentation\n- Enhanced provider implementations with better error handling",
